      "id": "INV-SOCKET-INCOMING-AUTH",
      "class": "repeat_operation",
      "contract": "A valid access token or active API key authenticates the socket as its user: init names that user (exactly userId/username for non-admins), users.lastSeen is written, and the user is listed once by GET /api/users/online; an inactive user is rejected with Invalid user until reactivated; authenticating the same socket again emits a second init and reports the previous auth's lastSeen in the second user_online, and authenticating it as another user moves the connection to that user; rejected credentials change no users row.",
